<title>USA: Scios cites Wisconsin investment board vote.</title>
<headline>Scios cites Wisconsin investment board vote.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scios Inc said the State of Wisconsin Investment Board plans to vote its 2,009,100 shares of stock against three stockholder proposals to be voted on at the annual meeting of stockholders on May 13.</p>
<p>The proposals are: to have the board appoint a committee to seek a buyer of the Company; to require the chairman to be an independent director, and to establish a shareholder advisory committee to the board.</p>
